  "label": "Antisemitic Threat: Nuclear Weapons",
  "description": "The explicit mention of '72 nukes aimed at Israel' is a hyperbolic and threatening statement that leverages the fear of nuclear annihilation to intimidate and incite violence. In the context of antisemitism, such threats are often used to portray Jewish people or the State of Israel as a dangerous, existential threat to the world, reinforcing the 'Jewish world conspiracy' myth and justifying violent action against them.",
